[{:db/id "q-49546/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" :answer/id #uuid "a49f572c-a2e7-5ad0-82cc-bbac19d02802" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49546/selection/f0f45940ed5df71758de7ff31ea171bc0689f380be113b3538530f3180b5105f" :answer/id #uuid "776498a3-8e67-5302-b303-ef2cc1d2f1e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49546/selection/35d0af53e25a7911f6d08c6d063fcf9231a1273a16a0f7056530d6f5d5dfbdd8" :answer/id #uuid "3fb3e6b9-359d-527e-b381-b4210d9e007d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49546/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" :answer/id #uuid "3eeafe43-e719-50d8-85c5-4b97ae46b68a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49546/selection/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5" :answer/id #uuid "a561a950-d397-503f-92e6-09e6900ad861" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49546/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6d4aa951-af9b-5825-9a3d-c4e6a9a0a712" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49546/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" :answer-field/choices ["q-49546/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" "q-49546/selection/f0f45940ed5df71758de7ff31ea171bc0689f380be113b3538530f3180b5105f" "q-49546/selection/35d0af53e25a7911f6d08c6d063fcf9231a1273a16a0f7056530d6f5d5dfbdd8" "q-49546/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" "q-49546/selection/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49546" :question/id #uuid "b6c3a048-1e47-59de-8a45-c489c544f459" :question/math-academy-id "q-49546" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{-5/2}^{5/2}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\sqrt{25-{x}^{2}}}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-5/2}^{5/2}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\sqrt{25-{x}^{2}}}\\, & ={\\int }_{-5/2}^{5/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/25)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{-5/2}^{5/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/25}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{-5/2}^{5/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/5)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{5})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{5}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{5}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=5\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nBefore substituting, we use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $-\\frac{5}{2}$ | $\\frac{5}{2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $-\\frac{1}{2}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-5/2}^{5/2}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\sqrt{25-{x}^{2}}} & =\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{-5/2}^{5/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/5)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{-1/2}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (5\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1/2}^{1/2}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u{|}_{-1/2}^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{\\pi }{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-49546/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f2f9806d-3a72-5f0a-a6f4-db8dad8871f6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49546"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186064851 :question/answer-fields 17592186063616] {:db/id "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/d144e0dd91b1007d0facbffcd16d653974156815aed1d1568e356432ac25761b" :answer/id #uuid "2a5e0987-5dd6-58f6-afd4-e850f1bd4974" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/f0df3091c01fd545c3ee5aef9729e9233c43bc4c42c361dd596288ffb87a0054" :answer/id #uuid "a42e9ab2-f8e1-5790-8b1e-01e07d816281" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(8x)}{8}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/d5dce8752bc5bf6bb76be1b0bdb95720c80f3b77cdf9cce4d09d26c692abb181" :answer/id #uuid "a256eb39-0a5c-5bdf-b751-4a56f59a8ef3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(4x)}{4}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/56e8cc50b5ee4dd8eb2296a06a6cc858e7e9e4e373571cfe841a64b4311c6dff" :answer/id #uuid "71ac8127-e14e-56c4-a515-c5897606da56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/2cf63e9be2c42a353700e6b6037d28b09cca019d0c7f50915356c955ef3b48c2" :answer/id #uuid "89246796-f084-535b-9bcf-74cb453b66b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(64x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f" :answer-field/id #uuid "b69123c2-7d5f-5bb8-933f-37f2977e820c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/d144e0dd91b1007d0facbffcd16d653974156815aed1d1568e356432ac25761b" :answer-field/choices ["q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/d144e0dd91b1007d0facbffcd16d653974156815aed1d1568e356432ac25761b" "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/f0df3091c01fd545c3ee5aef9729e9233c43bc4c42c361dd596288ffb87a0054" "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/d5dce8752bc5bf6bb76be1b0bdb95720c80f3b77cdf9cce4d09d26c692abb181" "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/56e8cc50b5ee4dd8eb2296a06a6cc858e7e9e4e373571cfe841a64b4311c6dff" "q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f/2cf63e9be2c42a353700e6b6037d28b09cca019d0c7f50915356c955ef3b48c2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-69476"] :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{8\\,\\text{d}x}{|8x|\\sqrt{(8x)^{2}-1}}=$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{8\\,\\text{d}x}{|8x|\\sqrt{(8x)^{2}-1}}=8\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|8x|\\sqrt{(8x)^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $8x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=8x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=8\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{8}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}8\\int \\frac{1}{|8x|\\sqrt{(8x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x & =8\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{8}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec}(8x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-69476/selection/ma-v1/ff07d5663eb4094ff4b73020a46fe98417ee80023111bfdf73ae7154883b469f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-73718/selection/6f1c8e42680e609067522949f1d0e8b5002d0ff7e542f2ac32c560ee9cae93d5" :answer/id #uuid "adb69dc9-6195-56ff-b839-818aede78a54" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73718/selection/4a0689793f0a34e2bd18356051b63044c195c280298c89be0505eb24137315c3" :answer/id #uuid "b22db8de-8bc0-51eb-a8f8-01c6a1c13c66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\,\\text{arcsec}(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73718/selection/0aa660cf27ed5ea7886c662271646156ac613a5cf9ab27b48067951f64d54030" :answer/id #uuid "1dd4861b-8cb0-523d-bb3c-5e1ce1d22a8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(5x)}{5}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73718/selection/a8d43b925836efa553e665ad78b8dcb96b604f14c81cfe9c3847d41b6b64ecf7" :answer/id #uuid "2e971d87-82dc-5ce6-b986-b95dcbe2c313" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{arctan}(5x)}{5}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73718/selection/abad39747e83b76470cfbbc3259a859ac690e044239b52b7f74978d03bd2c5b5" :answer/id #uuid "27341bc8-8f58-540c-aa5e-78dde30499c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\,\\text{arctan}(5x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73718/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d56cc81d-323e-50ef-89fd-350113ffd0ff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73718/selection/0aa660cf27ed5ea7886c662271646156ac613a5cf9ab27b48067951f64d54030" :answer-field/choices ["q-73718/selection/6f1c8e42680e609067522949f1d0e8b5002d0ff7e542f2ac32c560ee9cae93d5" "q-73718/selection/4a0689793f0a34e2bd18356051b63044c195c280298c89be0505eb24137315c3" "q-73718/selection/0aa660cf27ed5ea7886c662271646156ac613a5cf9ab27b48067951f64d54030" "q-73718/selection/a8d43b925836efa553e665ad78b8dcb96b604f14c81cfe9c3847d41b6b64ecf7" "q-73718/selection/abad39747e83b76470cfbbc3259a859ac690e044239b52b7f74978d03bd2c5b5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73718" :question/id #uuid "0bbddd4b-1bd5-542e-9d15-dd3b35f6f40f" :question/math-academy-id "q-73718" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{5|x|\\sqrt{25{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{5|x|\\sqrt{25{x}^{2}-1}}=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|5x|\\sqrt{(5x)^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $5x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=5x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{5|x|\\sqrt{25{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{|5x|\\sqrt{(5x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{arcsec}(5x)}{5}+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-73718/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8d18bdc7-9387-5b2d-98bd-015fa4a1eba7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73718"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114035/selection/93bf8528d05d119ae6d6cad270582f847ad3655b148f9a9591f0fda74b969fc1" :answer/id #uuid "496787cf-20ba-589f-bc48-a8f4411b8f02" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{5}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114035/selection/f6c1befb6fc791d9303f2ce171e1a37a479237bdb3ca144215ba89dbb30dcee7" :answer/id #uuid "b6d2cb98-0809-5a37-ad14-29d9d43efd94" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114035/selection/787195aeba437f444a79fc3d7b30987e76b1f0146afa27ca3a463ad1174197af" :answer/id #uuid "56c023cb-ff0e-547e-8dbf-4804a1d42a97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{5}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114035/selection/9febb1a7034df9977a16088cadfe6bddd5ca596b770857202d189e4fb74f28e3" :answer/id #uuid "28379061-67bd-5ac5-b4a6-b9761fbf6c90" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114035/selection/4eed92730686096791872ef65e423c135ce8a6c11a65f58a7d0c06500c53e871" :answer/id #uuid "89cf2c27-6756-5ca7-831a-9d6ee9325cf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{5}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114035/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7c120401-7883-54dd-aec7-28ba54869b16" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114035/selection/4eed92730686096791872ef65e423c135ce8a6c11a65f58a7d0c06500c53e871" :answer-field/choices ["q-114035/selection/93bf8528d05d119ae6d6cad270582f847ad3655b148f9a9591f0fda74b969fc1" "q-114035/selection/f6c1befb6fc791d9303f2ce171e1a37a479237bdb3ca144215ba89dbb30dcee7" "q-114035/selection/787195aeba437f444a79fc3d7b30987e76b1f0146afa27ca3a463ad1174197af" "q-114035/selection/9febb1a7034df9977a16088cadfe6bddd5ca596b770857202d189e4fb74f28e3" "q-114035/selection/4eed92730686096791872ef65e423c135ce8a6c11a65f58a7d0c06500c53e871"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114035" :question/id #uuid "7e87ee1c-de87-5e56-a6b4-aa28a90fdbbc" :question/math-academy-id "q-114035" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{1+5{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $5{x}^{2}=(\\sqrt{5}x)^{2}.$\n\nThus, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{5}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{5}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{1+5{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{5}x)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{5}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114035/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "227abe29-6e31-5afd-b0ca-3b8ed7d8c287"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114035"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346451/field-1/438469ab2d71e1bb8b63f3164bacb1bbb54e29062b14dce6a666b63ac0081609" :answer/id #uuid "34c2111c-2cfb-58ce-b087-b6d80745941d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346451/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "aadbb490-6fb4-5470-9fd1-82edbc4e8d0f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346451/field-1/438469ab2d71e1bb8b63f3164bacb1bbb54e29062b14dce6a666b63ac0081609" :answer-field/choices ["q-346451/field-1/438469ab2d71e1bb8b63f3164bacb1bbb54e29062b14dce6a666b63ac0081609"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346451" :question/id #uuid "e5f9130a-300a-596a-99eb-3945ea847a84" :question/math-academy-id "q-346451" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1/3}\\frac{2}{1+9{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $9{x}^{2}=(3x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=3x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nBefore substituting, we use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\frac{1}{3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}\\frac{2}{1+9{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}\\frac{1}{1+(3x)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1)-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}(\\frac{\\pi }{4}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-346451/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f2f9806d-3a72-5f0a-a6f4-db8dad8871f6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346451"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
